<title>USA: Ryerson Tull sees $0.11/shr gain from sale.</title>
<headline>Ryerson Tull sees $0.11/shr gain from sale.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryerson Tull Inc said Friday it will record a pretax gain of $7.0 million, or $0.11 a share, in the quarter ending this month from the sale of a building and land associated with its Boston facility.</p>
<p>The company said it is servicing the Boston market from nearby Ryerson Tull facilities.</p>
<p>Ryerson Tull distributes and processes metals.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
